   "text": "How to read it\nYellow = AI steps (THINK, PLAN)\nBlue = plain code we control\nPurple diamond = safety checks\nGrey dashed = pause, waits for a person\nGreen / red = end states\nMode 1 workflow · 2 simple loop · 3 plan first",
